# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify. The Vercel equivalent is in vercel.json and the
# Caddy one in deploy/Caddyfile — all three must say the same thing.
#
# The Slidev deck is a single-page app: /smolvla-presentation/7 is a client
# route, not a file, so a reload or a shared deep link has to be answered with
# the deck's own index instead of the site's 404. Real files under that prefix
# (assets, figs, videos) are matched before this rule and are unaffected.
/smolvla-presentation/*    /smolvla-presentation/index.html    200
